EWARM/*/Obj/
EWARM/*/List/
EWARM/*/Exe/
EWARM/settings/
*.dep
*.ewt
*.ewp.bak
*.ewd.bak
Backup of *.ewp
Backup of *.ewd
*.cspy.bat
*.mac.bak

# --- STM32CubeMX ---
.mxproject
*.ioc.bak

# --- CLion / JetBrains ---
.idea/
*.iml
*.clion-backup

# --- 编译产物文件类型 ---
*.o
*.obj
*.d
*.su
*.lst
*.elf
*.hex
*.bin
*.map
*.axf
*.a
*.lib
*.la
*.so
*.dll
